# An STM32 general-purpose timer (STM32F4's TIM2, 10 MHz) with a 1 MHz
# update event, its four compare channels unused, while a Cortex-M4 at 100
# MIPS spins: the clock source's update path and STM32_Timer's update event
# (PRs 08 and 09), about 250,000 events in the measured 0.25 s.
$warmup?="0.05"
$measure?="0.25"
mach create
machine LoadPlatformDescription @platforms/cpus/stm32f4.repl
cpu PerformanceInMips 100
cpu AssembleBlock 0x20000000 """
loop:
b loop
"""
cpu PC 0x20000000
sysbus WriteDoubleWord 0x4000002C 9
sysbus WriteDoubleWord 0x40000000 1
include $ORIGIN/_measure.resc
